Package: heatwave3
Version: 1.1.2
Date: 2026-06-02
Title: Detect Heatwaves and Cold-Spells in Gridded Data
Description: Detect marine heatwaves (MHWs) and cold-spells directly on gridded
    NetCDF data using the Hobday et al. (2016, 2018) definition. Implements
    climatology calculation, event detection, exceedance analysis, event
    categorisation, blob detection, and visualisation. All core algorithms are
    written in C++ with OpenMP parallelism for high performance on large datasets.
